                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sterile bee whose specialty is to support the hive, especially by collecting pollen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e68a9b2b-eaa6-4cc2-b5cf-9cbb7e364707",
                                                "sense_id": "1e8df968-ecc0-306d-b770-670d4507e73b",
                                                "text": "Then, a worker bee has got six thousand eyes of each side of its head so it can see the flowers that it wants to get the pollen and the nectar from."
